{"reviews":[{"id":"B0777W6C4X-0","r":3.0,"t":"It holds the polish and its cute. That\u2019s about it.","x":"I really wanted these to work for me. I\u2019m so disappointed because I purchased the two pack so that I could give one to my mom for her birthday and keep one for myself (it was a much better deal to get the two pack instead of just the single). I used it once and I was not impressed at all. It\u2019s very cute and the perfect shade of light pink. But functionality was not there. I put my china glaze nail polish in it and put it on my middle and ring fingers of my left hand and started to paint my toe n","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-1","r":5.0,"t":"These are awesome. Saw on youtube a person using while weeding ...","x":"These are awesome.  Saw on youtube a person using while weeding vinyl and thought wow that's cool so had to purchase and it works great for those  tiny pieces.!!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-2","r":5.0,"t":"Great for weeding!","x":"I don't use these for nail polish. Instead, I use these for vinyl weeding and they are PERFECT! If you're tired of having to fiddle with the little weeded parts of the vinyl, get this! The vinyl pulls off your tool with ease by utilizing the slits on the Tweexy. When you're done, the vinyl can pulled out and removed easily!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-3","r":4.0,"t":"I kept one and I really like it. It\u2019s not as smooth/soft as I thought ...","x":"Just bought this as a Christmas gift. I kept one and I really like it. It\u2019s not as smooth/soft as I thought it would be. It\u2019s a little more of a rough texture but that\u2019s my only con. I have 2 toddlers and painting nails can be a difficult task. My daughter would always grab for the bottle that had to be sitting next to me on the table. But with this it\u2019s so nice because I don\u2019t have to worry about her grabbing at it. It holds all my nail polish nicely and didn\u2019t hurt my hand/ fingers while I\u2019m w","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-4","r":5.0,"t":"Neat and useful","x":"I absolutely love this gadget. I'm not using it for it's intended purpose but for cricut weeding scraps. I was using an empty wipe container but it felt like it was so far away. But this little contraption is near and allows me to weed quickly throughout my projects.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-5","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome for Vinyl weeding!!!","x":"I had vinyl scraps all over me or my craft table.  Kept one for me & gave other to a friend who works at a T-shirt place & she gets stuck doing all the weeding of the vinyl designs.  She was so happy to get one as well!!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-6","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to use","x":"These work great. They make painting nails so much easier and less likely to spill polish and make a mess.  I loved them so much, I ordered them for my teenage nieces as well. They love them as well.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-7","r":5.0,"t":"So handy!","x":"Like it so much I had to order one for my daughter.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-8","r":5.0,"t":"Such a useful product!","x":"This works exactly as advertised!  I was able to use it while polishing my nails, and it securely held my nail polish, and with the bottle being near your hands, there was not the concern of spilling or tipping the bottle over as it is when you have the bottle on the table. My niece also loves it! I was glad to purchase them as two units, because if you buy one for  yourself, this will guarantee that you can keep yours without it being constantly borrowed! LOL!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-9","r":5.0,"t":"Convenience at your fingertips!","x":"My wife and adult daughters absolutely love these. I've been told that I will be ordering a few more for grand-daughters very soon. I checked out the items when they were delivered and the quality is great, very flexible yet durable. I tried to find a flaw but honestly couldn't, so I was impressed!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-10","r":5.0,"t":"Love this. Fits all my polished sizes.","x":"I got one for me while looking for Christmas gifts to add to stocking. I fell in love with it for me that I got all of us girls one in the family. They all love theirs too. It's fits all my different polished and perfect for the person that thinks they can polished their nails in bed. Ha!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great for weeding projects","x":"Are use this for weeding project they make him a cricket. It\u2019s really easy because you can put your cricket hook right into there and it pulls the vinyl off the hook without having it stick everywhere.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-12","r":5.0,"t":"Words Perfectly!!!","x":"I'm new to the vinyl world ~ saw these on a group on FB.  They are exactly what I need for the smaller vinyl pieces to quickly throw away.  Glad I got these!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-13","r":5.0,"t":"Works great","x":"Used it for the first time shortly after I got it. Definitely made it easier  to do my nails. The 2 pack was nice. Able to gift one and keep one for myself","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-14","r":5.0,"t":"Bought to use with cricut designs","x":"So I bought these for a cricut idea I use them to weed out all my designs and it works amazingly and also holds nail pooling like it\u2019s intended to as well","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great for cricut vinyl!","x":"I bought these for weeding with my cricut. It is definitely great for the little annoying pieces so they don\u2019t stick everywhere else!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-16","r":5.0,"t":"Great for weeding projects","x":"Love this as an accessory while I weed out my cricut projects makes it easier for me to just put my scraps in and keep on going.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-17","r":5.0,"t":"Smart buy and multipurpose","x":"These things make painting my nails so much easier. I got two so I could use one for nails and one for weeding craft vinyl.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-18","r":5.0,"t":"Work amazingly","x":"Very helpful when painting nails. Also came with the cutest mini nail files that will fit perfectly in my purse!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-19","r":5.0,"t":"I loved it! Definitely makes it way easier to paint ...","x":"I loved it! Definitely makes it way easier to paint my nails. I gave the second one to a friend for Christmas.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-20","r":5.0,"t":"My crafting buddy","x":"I use it when weeding my vinyl and it works like a charm! It keeps all the sticky stuff in one compact place.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-21","r":5.0,"t":"Genius","x":"I\u2019m just upset with myself I didn\u2019t think of this first! This product is genius! Buy for every girlfriend!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-22","r":3.0,"t":"Not as helpful as I would have liked.","x":"Fits finger & nailpolish well but due to natural hand motions, concept doesn\u2019t work as well as I expected.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-23","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"Got this for a friend and these came in very fast. Tried one on and I love it. She is going to love this","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B0777W6C4X-24","r":4.0,"t":"Finger holes are a little tight but Very good product.","x":"These are extremely cute and helpful for us clumsy people. I gave them as gifts and everyone was happy!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers use the product for vinyl/Cricut weeding rather than nail polish, and find it works great for small pieces and scraps.","cites":[2,3,5,6,12,13,15]},{"text":"Reviewers say it makes painting nails easier and reduces spills or tipping of the polish bottle.","cites":[7,9,11,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers liked it enough to buy multiples or gift them to family and friends.","cites":[6,7,8,10,11,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the texture is rougher or less smooth/soft than expected.","cites":[1,4]},{"text":"One reviewer was disappointed and not impressed after using it once.","cites":[1]}]},"qa":[]}